    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i'm literally just sitting on my couch right now and i feel okay, just a really bad headache. i don't have any nausea or vision stuff like i usually do with a migraine. if i just wait a couple hours to see if the pain levels out, would that be okay? i'm just so sure it's just a bad flare up because of the stress i've been under lately. i'd rather stay home and rest than deal with the hospital if it's just stress.",
